4qjv|v|The hard, white, opaque, fine-grained substance constituting the tusks of the elephant. It is a variety of dentine, characterized by the minuteness and close arrangement of the tubes, as also by their double flexure. It is used in manufacturing articles of ornament or utility. ; The tusks themselves of the elephant, etc. ; Any carving executed in ivory. ; Teeth; as, to show one's ivories.	o:1m2m,48,1~1m2m,48,1
